 Adding a passkey to sign-in leaves the on-chain recovery rules as they are. Trust Wallet could use passkeys for wallet signing and provide independent recovery via guardians or backup devices. Hardware signers or independent multisig could protect larger transfers. The design can remove the single exportable seed and reduce the risk that one compromised phone can move funds on its own.
 
